flowchart TD
    APP[Applications of Discrete Math] --> CODE[Coding Theory]
    APP --> CRYPTO[Cryptography]
    APP --> FLOW[Network Flows]
    APP --> MATCH[Matching]
    APP --> SCHED[Scheduling]
    APP --> COLOR[Graph Coloring]
    APP --> TSP[Traveling Salesman Problem]

    CODE --> C1[Hamming Distance]
    C1 --> C2[Error detection]
    C1 --> C3[Error correction]
    C2 --> C2A["Min distance >= k+1"]
    C3 --> C3A["Min distance >= 2k+1"]
    C1 --> C4[Hamming Codes]
    C1 --> C5[Linear Codes]

    CRYPTO --> R1[Symmetric AES DES]
    CRYPTO --> R2[Asymmetric RSA ECC]
    CRYPTO --> R3[Diffie Hellman Key Exchange]
    CRYPTO --> R4[Digital Signatures]

    FLOW --> F1[Flow Network]
    FLOW --> F2[Max Flow Min Cut Theorem]
    FLOW --> F3[Ford Fulkerson Algorithm]
    FLOW --> F4[Edmonds Karp BFS]

    MATCH --> M1[Matching Definition]
    MATCH --> M2[Halls Marriage Theorem]
    MATCH --> M3[Hungarian Algorithm]

    SCHED --> S1[Critical Path Method]
    SCHED --> S2[Interval Scheduling]
    SCHED --> S3[Job Scheduling m Machines]

    COLOR --> G1[Register Allocation]
    COLOR --> G2[Map Coloring]
    COLOR --> G3[Exam Scheduling]

    TSP --> T1[NP Complete]
    T1 --> T2[MST 2-approximation]
    T1 --> T3[Christofides 1.5-approximation]
